Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 13:30:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add sidebar hide toggle for desktop layout

Introduce a menu button on the sidebar brand row to collapse navigation on
wide screens, with a matching control in the page header to show it again.
Persist the preference in localStorage and add localized aria labels.
